        <cpr:P3 rdf:resource="https://climatepolicyradar.wikibase.cloud/entity/Q763"/>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">The process of depositing waste into or onto the land in a controlled way. The definition covers both landfilling at internal sites (i.e., where a generator of waste is carrying out its own waste disposal at the place of generation) and at external sites.</cpr:P7>
    </rdf:Description>
