        <cpr:P3 rdf:resource="https://climatepolicyradar.wikibase.cloud/entity/Q973"/>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Communities that are significantly exposed to climate impacts due to their physical location. In line with the use of &quot;exposure&quot; in climate science, the same population may be subject to a range of current or projected climate hazards, each of which with their own level of likelihood.</cpr:P7>
