        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Ensuring that number of workers and their skills align with the needs of the green transition. This includes all people engaged in or available for work, and can be specific to a country or area or in a particular firm or industry. Jobs should also be meaningful, safe and healthy, as well as well paid.</cpr:P7>
    </rdf:Description>
