        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Coal is a fossil fuel and non-renewable energy source consisting of solid, carbonised plant material that accumulated and transformed under heat and pressure over millions of years. It is classified into types such as hard coal, brown coal and derived coal products, and is chiefly used for electricity generation, steelmaking and other industrial processes.</cpr:P7>
