        <cpr:P2 rdf:resource="https://climatepolicyradar.wikibase.cloud/entity/Q709"/>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">This class includes activities of international organizations under treaties between states, such as the UN and its agencies, regional bodies, the IMF, World Bank, WCO, OECD, OPEC, EFTA, and EU institutions. It also encompasses activities of foreign government agencies like embassies, consulates, military, and scientific bases.</cpr:P7>
    </rdf:Description>
