        <cpr:P3 rdf:resource="https://climatepolicyradar.wikibase.cloud/entity/Q955"/>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">This sector includes extracting solid minerals (coal, ores), liquid (petroleum), and gas (natural gas) from mines, seabeds, and water. Methods include underground/surface mining, well operation, and seabed mining. It covers activities like crushing, grinding, cleaning, and drying, and includes fossil fuels, metal ores, minerals, quarry products, and hydrocarbon extraction services.</cpr:P7>
    </rdf:Description>
