        <cpr:P20 xml:lang="en">grw5x8ee</cpr:P20>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">This sector includes transforming materials into new products through physical, chemical, or biological processes, including alteration, renovation, or reconstruction of goods. Outputs can be finished or semi-finished. It includes factoryless goods producers who control production and provide intellectual property. Assembly of components and waste recovery into secondary products are included.</cpr:P7>
    </rdf:Description>
