        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">This sector includes water collection, treatment, and supply, sewerage systems, waste collection, treatment, disposal activities, and remediation services. It covers the operation of sewage plants, treatment of solid and hazardous waste, and environmental cleanup. Excluded are the management of electric power, gaseous fuels, and heating and cooling supply networks.</cpr:P7>
    </rdf:Description>
